{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have fun with friends!</strong><br>Jump into a race full of adrenaline, sharp turns, and wild contact. Bumping and shoving opponents is not only allowed\u2014it\u2019s encouraged!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the single-player mode and test your skills against computer-controlled opponents. Compare your results with other players and show who the true champion is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Fast, wild, and contact-heavy races \u2013 bumping and shoving are part of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Time attack - Compare your times with others and aim for the fastest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Each track can be driven in reverse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u25a0 Races in daylight, under overcast skies, and at night</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u25a0 Various difficulty levels \u2013 from beginners to experienced drivers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u25a0 Adjustable maximum number of opponents </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Local split-screen for up to 4 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  \u25a0 Up to 15 opponents in single-player and split-screen modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Option to race against AI-controlled opponents</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1627060?t=1763575539","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1627060?t=1763575539","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627060/c057aa83cf18347acc94030c202d6967aec7562b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763575539","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627060/c057aa83cf18347acc94030c202d6967aec7562b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763575539","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"